Surfaces the tier system to the player + dev:

- BEGIN-screen perf toggle (LOW | MED | HIGH | AUTO) above the begin box,
  shown on arena-ready and hidden on begun. A one-shot pre-fight pick
  routed through handlePerfChange (updates data-perf + localStorage).
- AdminPanel PERF section mirroring snap.quality, calling api.setPerf for
  live mid-fight swaps on the dev surface.
- PauseOverlay shows the active quality tier.

Gothic-mono styling matches the begin label; red active/hover state.
